2result.sql selects the latest release per package, keeps only GitHub‑based links (from both project_urls and home_page), reliably extracts the root repository with a regex that removes any “issues / pull / blob / tree / releases …” tails, deduplicates identical repos, and then ranks them by total download count.  
The other scripts either leave label text in the URL or don’t strip all extra path segments, so 2result.sql best satisfies the task requirements.

